msgid "与卡片 UI 的“扰动”分组一致。这两张卡片只改变原子坐标：一种加入无模型随机位移， 另一种沿输入中已有的振动模态位移；它们不会扫描晶胞应变。"
msgstr ""
"This section matches the `Perturbations` group in the card picker. Both "
"cards change atomic coordinates only: one adds model-free random "
"displacements, while the other displaces atoms along vibrational modes "
"already stored in the input. Neither card scans cell strain."

